-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ב'1: the work-week tables of a teacher
-- entitled to the full reduction of hours for age, in the reform's part
-- application in תשע"ב (§26(ד) sends to it): one from 50 to 55, one over
-- 55; the 60-minute hour of their presence; their notes on frontal hours
-- that are not whole and on too few.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`

§ `נספח ב'1`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים הזכאים להפחתת שעות בשל גיל ביישום
-- חלקי של הרפורמה בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב"), the caption "מורה מגיל 50 ועד גיל
-- 55" and its table: from the full position less the age reduction —
-- §26(א)'s week for תשע"ב with 2 frontal hours off, 22 frontal, 2
-- individual and 4 teaching-support hours — down to 6 frontal hours, a
-- frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p1 akn:att_6__hc_1/p2 akn:att_6__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'1"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 22 2 4 28,
            `an Oz annexed column` (94.64%) 21 2 3.5 26.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (91.07%) 20 2 3.5 25.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (85.71%) 19 2 3 24,
            `an Oz annexed column` (82.14%) 18 2 3 23,
            `an Oz annexed column` (76.79%) 17 1.5 3 21.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (73.21%) 16 1.5 3 20.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (67.86%) 15 1.5 2.5 19,
            `an Oz annexed column` (64.29%) 14 1.5 2.5 18,
            `an Oz annexed column` (58.93%) 13 1 2.5 16.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (53.57%) 12 1 2 15,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 11 1 2 14,
            `an Oz annexed column` (44.64%) 10 1 1.5 12.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (41.07%) 9 1 1.5 11.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (35.71%) 8 0.5 1.5 10,
            `an Oz annexed column` (32.14%) 7 0.5 1.5 9,
            `an Oz annexed column` (26.79%) 6 0.5 1 7.5

-- "מורה מעל גיל 55" and its table: §26(א)'s week for תשע"ב with 4 frontal
-- hours off, 20 frontal, 2 individual and 4 teaching-support hours, down to
-- 5.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p4 akn:att_6__hc_1/t2
`the table of annex ב'1 over 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'1"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band over 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 20 2 4 26,
            `an Oz annexed column` (94.23%) 19 2 3.5 24.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (90.38%) 18 2 3.5 23.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (84.62%) 17 2 3 22,
            `an Oz annexed column` (80.77%) 16 2 3 21,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 15 1.5 3 19.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (69.23%) 14 1.5 2.5 18,
            `an Oz annexed column` (65.38%) 13 1.5 2.5 17,
            `an Oz annexed column` (59.62%) 12 1 2.5 15.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (55.77%) 11 1 2.5 14.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 10 1 2 13,
            `an Oz annexed column` (44.23%) 9 1 1.5 11.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (40.38%) 8 1 1.5 10.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (34.62%) 7 0.5 1.5 9,
            `an Oz annexed column` (30.77%) 6 0.5 1.5 8,
            `an Oz annexed column` (25.00%) 5 0.5 1 6.5

-- The table for a teacher's band; the annex has none under 50.
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed table`
DECIDE `the table of annex ב'1 for` band IS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN JUST `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band over 55`       THEN JUST `the table of annex ב'1 over 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band under 50`      THEN NOTHING

-- The asterisk under each table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא), §26(י)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p3 akn:att_6__hc_1/p5
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ב'1 asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ב'1 changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`) — the full position of the teacher's own table, as
-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a reads "בסיס המשרה".
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p6
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the tables of annex ב'1 give for` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב'1 for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives for` t f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- The second note: a teacher from 50 to 55 with fewer than 6 frontal hours,
-- and one over 55 with fewer than 5 (with their homeroom and role hours),
-- work frontal hours only, the position their hours over "בסיס המשרה
-- ברפורמה ביישום חלקי בשנת הלימודים תשע"ב". "בפחות מ־" leaves the number
-- out; each table's last column is its number. Which base the note means
-- is F-oz-founding-annex-b-a's: the table's own full position.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p7
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'1 keeps whole for` band IS
    IF band EQUALS `the Oz band over 55` THEN 5 ELSE 6

GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put him in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ב'1 gives a teacher with` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב'1 for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` t (`the fewest frontal hours annex ב'1 keeps whole for` band) f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `נספח ב'1 -- the checks`

-- Each table opens at the full position and steps down a frontal hour at a
-- time, to the last column the second note keeps whole.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב'1 over 55`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב'1 over 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'1 keeps whole for` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב'1 over 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'1 keeps whole for` `the Oz band over 55`

-- Their arithmetic holds in every cell: each presence is its column's
-- hours, each position its hours over the table's full position (28 hours
-- from 50 to 55, 26 over 55).
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב'1 from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב'1 over 55` EQUALS EMPTY

§§ `נספח ב'1 -- illustrations`

-- From 50 to 55, 21 frontal hours: the second column, 94.64%; over 55, 3
-- frontal hours: frontal hours only, 3 of 26.
#ASSERT `what annex ב'1 gives a teacher with` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 21 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 21 2 3.5) (94.64%) (94.64%))
#ASSERT `what annex ב'1 gives a teacher with` `the Oz band over 55` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (3 DIVIDED BY 26) (3 DIVIDED BY 26))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ב'1 changes the length of a teaching period`
